9
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:25,060
Teacher Bai and Yuxi immediately injured her and gave birth to her.

10
00:00:25,060 --> 00:00:28,120
This man is too much, right?

11
00:00:28,120 --> 00:00:32,900
Teacher Bai, take it

12
00:00:32,900 --> 00:00:36,610
Let’s go. Zi Yan Lucy goes first.

13
00:00:36,610 --> 00:00:40,360
